	"Description": "[b][size=3]Config:\n<br />[/size][/b]Piercings - on, off\n<br />HairStyle - vanilla, custom\n<br />HairColor - purple, black\n<br />Lidded Eyes - on, off\n<br />Makeup - full, light, off\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[b][size=3]Installation:[/size][/b]\n<br />Drag and drop into mods folder\n<br />\n<br />Surprised this mod name wasn't taken yet.\n<br />\n<br />Abigail is a mix of multiple goth subcultures, because most real goth people don't stick to one style lol.\n<br />\n<br />I tested the mod out for like 15 minutes total so it might break or something.\n<br />Because of the configurable hair, when you click on Abigail in the social menu, she's bald. I don't know how to fix that\n<br />\n<br />\uFEFF[img]https://i.postimg.cc/wvQZ70FF/bald.png[/img]\n<br />\n<br />[size=1]\n<br />(took me like 3 days to figure out the new 1.6 appearance code...)[/size]",
